# INTERVAL              Seconds since last stored value, 0 is store every value
# STATE                 State of glider (dive, hover, climb), 15 is always store
# HALFYOS               # of dive/climbs in this segment to record for, -1 store for all
# YO_DUTY_CYCLE         Store data every n'th yo in this segment, -1 is every dive/climb

# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# SENSOR NAME           INTERVAL  STATE     HALFYOS   YO_DUTY_CYCLE
# (Defaults)            0         15        -1        -1
# --------------------------------------------------------------------

# 2010_01_21 	dkaragon		added m_gps_full_status, removed @ surface requirement for GPS and water velocities
# 2010_02_22 	dkaragon		changed sampling arguments to just sample 0   7   -1  2, the up/down and everyother sampling regime for thermal lag
# 2010_09_10 	dkaragon   		m_gps_status
# 2010_10_22	dkaragon		cleaned up a little, adjusted some values
# 2011_09_19	dkaragon		added sensors after ru16 loss, mostly LMC items, plus glider speed. Also more c_heading data, underwater data too m_lat,lon
# 2011_11_10	dkaragon		added x_cycle_overrun_in_ms, at low rate to monitor if glider is overloaded
# 2012_01_02	dkaragon		added CTD record for test mission
# 2012_03_14	dkaragon		added m_gps_mag_var to SBD
# 2012_03_24	dkaragon		removed CTD data except delimited pressure, it was making SBD's huge and we no longer need it for test mission since we merge
# 2012_07_09	dkaragon:		removed m_heading and replaced with m_hdg_error, deliminted c_heading a bit more
# 2012_08_13	dkaragon:		added x_inflecting, m_altitude
# 2012_10_12	dkaragon		added m_ballast_pumped; cleaned up timing on sensors to try and eliminate events of m_present_time with only 2 data points
# 2013_03_05	dkaragon:		added m_heading
# 2013_04_30	dkaragon:		added c_wpt_lat and c_wpt_lon
# 2013_09_16	dkaragon:		m_pressure now 30 seconds, m_water_depth 30 seconds.  Hopefully increase in file size offset by syncing benefits
# 2014_07_16	dkaragon:		made lots of changes, raw_altitude, increased heading measurements, made denser; added some parameters for the yo
# 2014_12_30	dkaragon		added m_battery_inst, u_low_power_cycle_time, synced with deep SBD a bit more
# 2015_07_08	dkaragon		sbd was too large on a coastal.  reported less on some steering sensors; added c_weight_drop
# 2016_03_17	dkaragon		added digifin leak; thruster
# 2016_04_28	dkaragon		added m_battery_inst
# 2016/08/26    dkaragon        added m_depth for surface monitoring.  ru32 drifting sensor; check file size
# 2016/10/25	dkaragon		ru22 coastal mission files were large'ish for 3 hour missions, > 20 KB, tried to lower pressure, m_water_depth sampling rates.
# 2017/2/21		dkaragon		added f_ocean_pressure_min,max
# 2017/12/30	dkaragon		added some compass fields m_dip_angle, m_magnetic_field; u_science_low_power
# 2018/7/31		dkaragon		added some bms variables and science leakdetect
# 2018/9/27		dkaragon		added some longer, slow record m_heading
# 2018/10/24	dkaragon		added m_comms_tickle_timestamp, m_vehicle_temp
# 2019/1/9		dkaragon		added x_current_target_altitude
# 2019/01/31	dkaragon		some cop  tickle timestamp and m_weight_drop
# 2019/07/17	dkaragon		added x_software_ver
# 2019/12/16	dkaragon		added m_science_clothesline_lag
